  "caveats": [
    "Classes are rule-based and data-calibrated; they are unvalidated pending M4 supervised validation and are not mining attribution.",
    "Each year is classified using only data up to that year, with its own trajectory refit and stability band. Class boundaries move between years and a pixel can change class purely from refitting.",
    "The most recent years of each frame sit at the end of a truncated series, where vertices are unstable and recovery is under-detected.",
    "DHR/DLR rate splits are not comparable across years."
